 your paintings, and I\u2019d like to commission a illustration of my OC.\nShe is a delicate and sensitive rabbit-like girl with a personality that doesn\u2019t smile much.\nThe pose and composition are up to you, I would really appreciate it if you could create a dreamy, fairy tale-like atmosphere.\nIf you\u2019re interested, feel free to check out the short storyline I wrote about my original characters. I hope it inspires your illustrations!\nhttps://level-chord-23a.notion.site/19624e849c5380feb3b6ded45484690f?pvs=4\nIf possible, I would appreciate having the character and background as separate layers\nFor personal use only (display on a personal website/non-commercial printing\u2026etc.) I will credit your ID!\nThank you for considering my request!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IjX6OZSX0r-cQ8sZi_CL4XxcvpNBSbj\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IjX6OZSX0r-cQ8sZi_CL4XxcvpNBSbj", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 732869, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u5347\u7531\u308b\u3080\ud83c\udf44", "screen_name": "Masuyu_rumu", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F05e01b1d-20dd-49db-a138-f12f6cb5f2bf.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/dac016ac-04d1-4bfb-a1ce-753bf03d4dc4.webp", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 3086424, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u611b\u72ac", "screen_name": "tasuketei_i", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1954490532258033664/Oqb3FDfR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profi